# Freeze in Place: "Tap target creature an opponent controls and put three stun counters on it. Scry 2." On turn 3 Bot1 casts it for {1}{U}
# (a Mox Sapphire and a Mox Jet: the pool is empty right after paying) on Bot2's Ornithopter: tapped with three stun counters (CR 701.26a, 122.1d),
# and Bot1 scries 2 (CR 701.22): the Library has Lightning Bolt then Counterspell; the Counterspell goes on top and the Bolt to the bottom.
# Bot1's own Ornithopter is refused as a target ("an opponent controls") while Bot2's is accepted.

[Bot1 Deck]
Freeze in Place
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Freeze in Place.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Hand.Freeze in Place.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Counterspell | Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Freeze in Place
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = (absent)
Bot1.Library.Top = Counterspell
Stack.Count = 0
